WEBVTT

00:02:26.434 --> 00:02:30.271
Instead, fun is the secret
to feeling alive.

00:02:31.647 --> 00:02:33.399
So today, I want to propose to you

00:02:33.399 --> 00:02:36.694
a new, more precise definition
of what fun is.

00:02:36.736 --> 00:02:40.698
I want to reveal some of the ways
in which it is astonishingly good for us,

00:02:40.698 --> 00:02:42.742
and I want to give you all
some suggestions

00:02:42.783 --> 00:02:47.455
for things you can do starting right now
to experience its power for yourself.

00:02:48.414 --> 00:02:50.374
So the first thing we need to start with

00:02:50.374 --> 00:02:53.794
is the fact that fun is a feeling,
and it's not an activity.

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:55.671
And that's important,

00:02:55.713 --> 00:02:58.716
because a lot of times,
when I ask people what's fun,

00:02:58.758 --> 00:03:01.469
they'll respond with a list
of activities that they enjoy.